* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RJREVIVE - Revive Active Report from Archive Data set
*
* Maintenance:
* uuu    yy-mm-dd s(999999)
* gw     98-06-24 p(171848)  revive retention ignored
* gw     98-07-16 p(172297)  recat for build list active bundle redesign
*                            to include prerequisites
* jvd    98-09-10 p(164220)  NOM141ÖNAT23
* xsisaa 99-03-12 p(180308)  Apply same changes as P#180288 here build
*                            correct dsn when revive to spool (BS2)
* sju    99-07-02 p(183979)  take active report revive retention details
* sju    99-10-04 p(187419)  disallow revive to connect if no LFILE 251
* fhi    99-11-12 S(188796)  Without NSC steplibs are not set.
* fhi    00-03-03 S(192651)  Line length > 253 not stored in DB
* sju    00-05-24 p(191368)  bundle revived report - call RMCRTBUN which
*                        does special processing when called by RJREVIVE
* xsisgg 00-07-05 p(195864)  add SYSEXT as asteplib is NSC is not activ
* fhi    00-07-26 QA01       add SYSNOMS as steplib if NSC is not active
* xsisgg 00-08-02 CE7265     revive job scheduled from NOP
* xsishz 00-08-15 (CE7461)   Extend Report and Bundle Names
* fhi    00-08-24 QA03       Use NAT23006 for error values
* sju    00-10-16 p(191368)  work with archives from NOM 1.4 and earlier
* sju    00-11-17 s(999999)  retention period not computed
* sju    00-11-21 s(999999)  Check setting of lfile 131 (SAT log file)
* jwo    01-02-19 s(206182)  Invoke NOMEX008 after delete
* sju    01-02-20 p(206182)  NOMEX008
* xsetggr01-12-19 p(209875)  add missing steplibs if NSC is not active
* sju    02-02-25 NOM221     New lfile for active data
* fhi    02-06-13 s(225125)  Add email notificaton, NOMEX010
* sju    02-08-07 NOM221     User defined archive types
* fhi    03-07-23 p(242064)  Unify steplib concatentation
* xsetggr03-11-27 p(246658)  correct existance check of steplib
* xsetggr04-11-24 p(258871)  change connect interface
* fhi    05-04-14 NOM3107    Added Support for 7 byte jobnumbers
* sju    05-07-27 p(267803)  Incorrect results after failed revive job
* fhi    05-06-23 p(266530)  Make Monitor NPR Mainframe independent
* fhi    05-09-06 p(267354)  Get real record count for JES2
* xsetggr05-10-26 P(270950)  ISN fields must be P10, not P8
* fhi    07-02-08            Commented statements deleted.
* fhi    07-02-22 FHI211     Get Revive work under Unix
* xsetggr07-05-04 NOM3201    Support 5 byte node numbers
* xsetggr07-05-04 NOM3201    Support 11 byte run numbers
* fhi    07-05-16 FHI229     Revive to Container File fails with 3148
* fhi    07-05-30 P297047    Replace RSTEPLIB, old comments deleted
* fhi    07-07-12 NOM3202    C-NATERR changed, NAD23006 is obsolete.
* xsetggr08-04-16 p(303915)  Honour length of 253 in decompressed rec
* xsetggr08-05-05 p(304350)  restow due to changes in RMSPL--L
* fhi    08-07-24 P307319    restow due to changes in DDM NRM-BUNDLE-C  ONTENTS
* xsetggr09-01-09 P313128    available revive archives of older NOM
*                            versions
* bli    09-01-21 p307959    restow due to unix attr changes in rmspl--l
* xsetggr09-02-24 P300323    make steplib handling unix compliant
* fhi    09-02-27 P300323    Rename RGETSTEP to NOMGSTEP delivered in SYSTEM
* fhi    09-08-26 P319282    Binary files on Linux corrupted
* fhi    09-09-15 P320367    Use compression routine NOMCOMPR
* xsetggr10-01-29 P322358    correct handle of id-records, correct back
*                         #WRITER (A8) due to WRITER format of ESY views
* fhi    10-08-31 NOMALL-93  Introduce trace levels                     STEM
* fhi    10-09-21 NOMALL-97  Use no more C-NATERR but C-NATERN instead
* fhi    11-11-14 NOMALL-1073 Do Revive on Unix with RJREVUX
* raya   11-12-27 NOMALL-98  check member to avoid err 82
* raya   12-02-15 NOMALL-98  remove error 1079 to avoide double
* ILDAV  12-06-27 NOMALL-1078 SUPPORT COMPRESSION 16K BYTE RECORDS
* raya   12-10-11 NOMALL-1143 work with lob fields
* xsetggr12-10-22 ES-104      fill MA-CURRENT-LOCATION
* fhi    12-11-09 NOMALL-1143 Add cpu time output
* raya   12-11-29 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of nomex*
* fhi    13-02-15 NOMALL-1143 backout: for future use
* xsetggr13-03-14 ES-104      corrections
* raya   13-05-09 NOMALL-1214 backout check cat date of nomex*
* fhi    13-09-24 NOMALL-932  Change NOMEX08L to NOMEXP08
* fhi    14-04-17 NOMALL-1378 Output of spool variables is bad.
* fhi    14-05-13 NOMALL-1378 Adding trace statements
* fhi    14-06-02 NOMALL-1422 Avoid VOLSER=*
